# Changelog

## [Unreleased]

### Fixed — Full Codebase Audit (2026-08-05)

**Rofi:**
- `shared/colors.rasi`: Fixed `@import` path — `$HOME` doesn't expand in rofi CSS, reverted to `~` which works

**Installer (1-install.sh + library.sh):**
- Fixed `SCRIPT_DIR` clobbering by library sourcing chain (library.sh, headers.sh, distro-detection.sh)
- `_installSymLink()` rewritten — removed interactive `read -p` prompts, now silent and non-interactive
- Fixed array comparison bug in `_installPackagesPacman`/`_installPackagesYay`
- Added `gum_choose_safe()` wrapper to prevent `set -e` crash on gum Esc
- Yay install now validates success (clone + build + post-install check)
- All 50+ hardcoded `~/hyprtk/` paths replaced with `$SCRIPT_DIR/...`
- Removed duplicate gvfs packages (were in both Hyprland and Network sections)
- Moved `cups`, `cups-pdf`, `cups-filters`, `nss-mdns` from yay to pacman (official repos)
- Removed duplicate `curl` and `python-pip` installs
- Removed deprecated `exa` (eza already installed)
- Fixed Nvidia GRUB sed pattern to match any existing `GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX` value
- Wallpaper copy now happens BEFORE `wal -i` (was reversed)
- Thunar launch now tracks PID with `kill`/`wait` instead of `killall`
- Fixed `pcp-pmda-*` expansion to check for empty results
- Quoted `$HOME/dotfiles` in removal command
- Removed 8 dead functions: `_installPackagesPacman`, `_installPackagesYay`, `_isInstalledAur`, `_installAurPackage`, `_isDirectoryExists`, `_isCommandExists`, `_checkAndInstallHyprviz`, `_checkAndInstallMatuwall`
- library.sh reduced from 377 to 218 lines (-37%)

**Waybar Configs:**
- `launch.sh`: Fixed shebang from `#!/bin/sh` to `#!/bin/bash`
- `default/config`: Replaced `wlr/workspaces` with `hyprland/workspaces`, removed sway-only modules
- `default/config`: Removed dead `custom/media` module referencing non-existent `mediaplayer.py`
- `default/style.css`: Added missing comma between `#mpd` and `#kbstate` selectors
- `modules.json`: Fixed `"tooltip": "true"` (string) to `"tooltip": true` (boolean)
- `themes/config`: Removed duplicate `"layer": "top"` key
- `themes/config`: Fixed module order to match hyprtk themes (cpu, memory, disk)
- `themes/config`: Fixed audio/hardware drawer `transition-left-to-right` to match hyprtk themes
- `themes/style.css`: Replaced 9 undefined CSS variables with concrete fallback values
- `themes/style.css`: Removed duplicate `#network` selector
- `themes/style.css`: Removed dead CSS selectors (custom-outlook, custom-teams, etc.)
- `hyprtk-inverse/style.css`: Removed 6 duplicate one-liner color declarations
- `hyprtk-light/style.css`: Removed 6 duplicate one-liner color declarations
- `themeswitcher.sh`: Quoted all variables to handle paths with spaces

**Shell Scripts:**
- Fixed broken shebangs in vmware-setup.sh, appimage-setup.sh, lockscreentime.sh, onedrive.sh, wal.sh
- `screenshot.sh`: Removed `eval`, fixed paths to use `$SCRIPT_DIR/settings/`, added nullglob for unguarded glob
- `change-icons.sh`: Fixed `OUTPUT_FILE` path (missing `configs/` prefix)
- `generate-aero-colors.sh`: Added `-f` check before `readlink -f`
- `rofi/shared/colors.rasi`: Kept `~` in @import (rofi expands tilde, does NOT expand `$HOME`)
- `rofi/config-cliphist.rasi`: Added missing `@import "shared/fonts.rasi"`
- `rofi/config-short.rasi`: Added missing `@import "shared/fonts.rasi"`
- `autolock.sh`: Wrapped in `$XDG_SESSION_TYPE = "x11"` check for Wayland compatibility
- `templates.sh`: Added `wl-copy` (Wayland) with `xclip` (X11) fallback
- `cleanup.sh` (both): Added `[y/N]` confirmation before destructive operations
- `wf-record-start.sh`: Quoted pgrep, fixed notification typo
- `wf-record-stop.sh`: Quoted pgrep, replaced broken wait loop with `sleep 0.2`, fixed tilde in double quotes
- `Volume.sh`: Removed stray `u` argument from `pamixer --default-source`
- `graphics-card.sh`: Fixed argument count mismatch for `update_initramfs_config`
- `graphics-card.sh`: Fixed Nvidia GRUB sed pattern (same fix as 1-install.sh)

**Hyprland Config (Lua format):**
- `keybindings.lua`: Removed duplicate `SUPER+SHIFT+P` binding (recording conflicted with passthru submap)
- `keybindings.lua`: Recording moved to `SUPER+SHIFT+p` (lowercase) to avoid conflict
- `keybindings.lua`: Fixed brightness hardcodes (`set 100%`/`set 70%` → `set 5%+`/`set 5%-`)
- `keybindings.lua`: Replaced 20 individual workspace binds with `for` loop (cleaner, like ml4w)
- `keybindings.lua`: Added `local hyprtk` variable for consistent path referencing
- `keybindings.lua`: Fixed workspace 10 keysym (was `10`, now `0`)
- `autostart.lua`: Removed `xhost +local:` (X11 command, not appropriate for Wayland)
- `autostart.lua`: Removed `lockscreentime.sh` call (X11-only xautolock)
- `autostart.lua`: Added `sleep 2` delay for wal-watcher startup
- `environment.lua`: Removed forced software rendering (`WLR_NO_HARDWARE_CURSORS`, `WLR_RENDERER_ALLOW_SOFTWARE`)
- `environment.lua`: Added Qt Wayland, Electron/Chromium Wayland, Mozilla Wayland env vars
- `window.lua`: Fixed dead code path (`if not colors_path` was always false)
- `window.lua`: Added fallback colors if pywal colors file missing
- `nvidia.lua`: Commented out all env vars, documented as opt-in (harmful on AMD/Intel)
- `hyprlock.conf`: Replaced deprecated `hide_cursor` with `no_pointer`
- `hyprlock.conf`: Fixed wallpaper path (was `.png` extension mismatch)
- Deleted orphaned `default.lua` (duplicate of layouts.lua, never required)
- Deleted orphaned `keyboard.lua` (undefined variable, never required)
- `wal-watcher.sh`: Removed missing `hyprlock_wall.sh` reference
- `wallpaper-colors.sh`: Removed missing `hyprlock_wall.sh` reference
- `volume-mute.sh`: Now shows actual volume on unmute instead of always 0
- `brightness-up.sh`/`brightness-down.sh`/`volume-up.sh`/`volume-down.sh`: Quoted all variables

**Architecture:**
- Removed 8 dead functions from library.sh
- Unified install pattern: only `_installOrUpdatePacman` and `_installOrUpdateYay` remain
- Added `2>/dev/null` to `_isInstalledPacman`/`_isInstalledYay` to suppress noisy errors

## [0.1.0] — 2026-08-03

### Added
- Initial release of hyprtk-merged
- Unified installer supporting 11 Arch-based distros
- TUI selector using gum (standalone binary)
- 147 unique packages across 10 categories
- 47 scripts in installer/scripts/
- 36 screenshots (3 per distro)
- 39 thumbnails (3 per distro)
- 8 waybar themes (hyprtk, hyprtk-aero, hyprtk-clear, hyprtk-inverse, hyprtk-light, hyprtk-negative, hyprtk-reverse, hyprtk-vertical)
- 7 rofi theme variants
- Hyprland Lua configuration (modular, requires-based)
- Pywal16 dynamic color theming
- matuwall wallpaper manager integration
- theme-gui GTK4 theme manager
- Papirus icon themes with 25 custom color variants
- GTK2/GTK3/GTK4 theme (Kripton-v40)
- SDDM login screen configuration
- GRUB splash screen
- Oh My Zsh + Starship prompt
- Alacritty, Kitty, btop, ranger, neovim configs
- dunst, wob, swappy, swaylock configs
- XFCE4 fallback desktop
